---
/**
 * The holding page (D15.4) — what cestecritla.fr serves while the app moves from the 2025 edition
 * of the programme to the 2026 one.
 *
 * Why it exists: on 5 November 2026 the source replaced "L'Avenir en commun, édition 2025" with
 * a new edition — a different structure, a rewritten text, and no longer under Creative Commons
 * (D15.1). The apex was still serving the September share spike, which printed 2025 text under
 * the label "Texte du programme". A page that says what is true is worth more than a page that
 * looks finished.
 *
 * What it must never contain: a single word of the programme, or a licence line. The link to the
 * book is the whole point — the legal notice of the source "authorises (and encourages)" links.
 *
 * Voice (design/voice.md): impersonal, because this page is reached by a link (D3.12); no word
 * of failure (rule 5: nothing here is broken); no date promise we could miss; sentences of
 * fifteen words or fewer.
 *
 * Old links (`/m/…`, `/a/…`, `/r/…`) are redirected here by dist/_redirects, written by
 * scripts/build.ts --holding. One sentence says so, so that nobody thinks they mistyped.
 *
 * Not indexed. The spike this page replaced sent `X-Robots-Tag: noindex` on every response, so
 * the apex had never been indexable; the first holding deploy changed that without anyone
 * having decided it (noticed on 12/11/2026 while verifying the takeover). The playbook opens
 * indexing at J-3, with the legal pages in place — not before, and not for a page whose only
 * message is "come back later".
 */
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

/** The 2026 book. Answers 200; the 2025 URL now redirects to it (observed 12/11/2026). */
const BOOK_URL = 'https://melenchon2027.fr/programme/livre/';

/** French typography (voice.md): a no-break space before the colon, written out so it shows. */
const description =
  'Site non officiel. L’Avenir en commun a été réédité le 5 novembre 2026 : ce site se met à jour.';
---

<Base title="C'est écrit là" description={description} noindex>
  <p class="label">Site non officiel.</p>
  <h1>C’est écrit là</h1>
  <p><cite>L’Avenir en commun</cite> a été réédité le 5 novembre 2026.</p>
  <p>Ce site s’appuyait sur l’édition 2025. Il se met à jour.</p>
  <p>Les anciens liens arrivent ici pour l’instant.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="cta" href={BOOK_URL} rel="noopener">Lire le programme sur melenchon2027.fr</a>
  </p>
  <p><small>Projet militant indépendant.</small></p>
</Base>
